<aside class="post-cta" aria-labelledby="post-cta-heading">
  <h2 id="post-cta-heading">If you liked this post</h2>
  <p>Here are a few easy ways to support or explore more:</p>
  <ul class="post-cta-actions">
    <li>Share this on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/submitlink?u={{ (metadata.url + page.url) | url }}&t={{ title | url }}" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" data-plausible-event-name="outbound-cta" data-plausible-event-target="hn-submit">Hacker News</a>.</li>
    <li>Join or start a <a href="https://github.com/jonmagic/jonmagic.com/discussions" data-plausible-event-name="outbound-cta" data-plausible-event-target="site-discussions">discussion about this post or my site</a>.</li>
    <li>Read more <a href="/posts/" data-plausible-event-name="internal-cta" data-plausible-event-target="cta-to-posts">writing</a> or browse my <a href="/projects/" data-plausible-event-name="internal-cta" data-plausible-event-target="cta-to-projects">projects</a>.</li>
    <li>Follow me on <a href="https://github.com/jonmagic" data-plausible-event-name="outbound-cta" data-plausible-event-target="github-jonmagic">GitHub</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  {%- set merchTile = false -%}
  {%- if merch -%}
    {%- for item in collections.merch -%}
      {%- if item.fileSlug == merch -%}{%- set merchTile = item -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if merchTile -%}
  <a class="post-merch-cta post-merch-cta--contextual"
     href="/merch/#{{ merchTile.fileSlug }}"
     aria-label="{{ merchTile.data.title }}. See it in the merch shop."
     data-plausible-event-name="internal-cta"
     data-plausible-event-target="post-merch-{{ merchTile.fileSlug }}">
    <img class="post-merch-thumb" src="{{ merchTile.data.image }}" alt="" width="120" height="132" loading="lazy">
    <span class="post-merch-copy">
      <strong>{{ merchTile.data.title }}</strong>
      <span>See it in the merch shop →</span>
    </span>
  </a>
  {%- elif not disableMerchCta -%}
  <a class="post-merch-cta"
     href="/merch/"
     aria-label="Browse jonmagic.com merch"
     data-plausible-event-name="internal-cta"
     data-plausible-event-target="post-merch-shop">
    <span class="post-merch-copy">
      <strong>You, me, and an LLM</strong>
      <span>Browse the merch shop →</span>
    </span>
  </a>
  {%- endif -%}

  <p class="post-cta-thanks">Thanks for reading — it means a lot.</p>
</aside>
